&gt;Tool: Select Styling Specimens&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>AI Skill v2.0 Introduces AI-Powered Design System Generator for UI/UX Development</title><link>https://shoubhikbanerjee.github.io/blog/p/ai-skill-v2-0-introduces-ai-powered-design-system-generator-for-ui-ux-development/</link><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 22:04:27 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://shoubhikbanerjee.github.io/blog/p/ai-skill-v2-0-introduces-ai-powered-design-system-generator-for-ui-ux-development/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246974152?v=4" alt="Featured image of post AI Skill v2.0 Introduces AI-Powered Design System Generator for UI/UX Development" /&gt;&lt;h1 id="ai-skill-v20-introduces-ai-powered-design-system-generator-for-uiux-development"&gt;AI Skill v2.0 Introduces AI-Powered Design System Generator for UI/UX Development
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;An AI skill has been developed to provide design intelligence for building professional UI/UX across multiple platforms and frameworks. The release of v2.0 introduces the Design System Generator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-overview"&gt;🔍 Overview
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides design intelligence for building professional UI/UX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports development across multiple platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports development across multiple frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-how-it-works"&gt;🧩 How it works
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design System Generator&lt;/strong&gt;: The flagship feature of v2.0 is an AI-powered reasoning engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirement Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;: The engine analyzes your project requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rapid Generation&lt;/strong&gt;: It generates a complete, tailored design system in seconds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-key-details"&gt;⚙️ Key details
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasoning Rules&lt;/strong&gt;: 192 Reasoning Rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Searchable Styles&lt;/strong&gt;: 79 searchable UI styles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Python 3.x.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#AISkill #DesignSystem #UIUX #Python&lt;/p&gt;
